/*
This file is a temporary mock data file for local testing.
Please do not use this file for production purposes.

Data format is as follows:
{
  "id": "LR" for lost, "FR" for found - followed by a unique number, ex. "LR-8821",

  "type": "LOST" or "FOUND",

  "status": "open", "possible-match", "resolved", or "cancelled",
  
  "date": "MM-DD-YYYY",

  "user": "user1", will eventually be replaced by unique user hash,

  "location": String for location, ex. "Memorial Student Center" or "Evans Library",

  "item": Item name / title, ex. "Black Hydroflask 32oz",

  "description": String for description entered by user,

  "itemType": String for type entered by user, ex. "Electronics" or "Clothing",
}

See mockdata.json for the harcoded example data. This file is to be used only as a reference/instruction for understanding the format.

*/
